{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of fps action and survival thriller in a dystopian, analogue horror-scape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oppressive atmosphere of isolation in a treacherous environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to earn new upgrades and unlock deeper sectors of the Domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the three mechanical horrors to undo the Domain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.poster.avif?t=1773159970\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.webm?t=1773159970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.mp4?t=1773159970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSIONS &amp; COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to progress through the game</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy structures to shift the Domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down Monsters to cull their population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover Blueprints to unlock new weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.poster.avif?t=1773159970\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447